{"id":"5fc33cbab29395e4","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency.md","title":"真理归纳与一致性证明","display":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 真理归纳与一致性证明","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency","aliases":["91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency","91-cor-ind-consistency","91-cor-provability-needs-induction"],"display":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 真理归纳与一致性证明","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency</span><span>91-cor-ind-consistency</span><span>91-cor-provability-needs-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 真理归纳与一致性证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (带全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳的标准 Kripke–Feferman 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 证明规则保持真性的全局反思结论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (基础语言句编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在通常的可递归公理化与一致性假设下，Gödel 第二不完备定理另给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳可用于对 PA 证明长度归纳，证明每一步都保持真性；\n若不存在真的矛盾，就不存在 PA 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 的证明。这说明真理归纳是\n标准 KF 一致性证明中的关键机制，但不能由此推出“每一种\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 证明都逻辑上必须使用真理归纳”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1936,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["08a0ab6453addb52","16b107dfee99998b","4e50c115b0d32044","a295446296ee06c0"]}